[Unit]
Description=Arc'emX! US brief grader, 22:15 UTC Mon-Fri (03:45 IST next day). The NYSE closes at 20:00 UTC in summer and 21:00 UTC in winter, so this is after the close in both with time for daily bars to settle. Each run grades whatever horizon has become gradeable.

[Timer]
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri *-*-* 22:15:00
AccuracySec=1s
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
